                            <p class="text-amber-800 text-sm mb-0">The release does not say the owner provided serials, and it does not say the guns came back because of a list. What it does say is that recovery can happen — including after the guns have left the state. Matching a recovered firearm back to a specific owner is serial-number and NCIC work.</p>
                        </div>
